                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k-age16"><lrml:Comment>已满十六周岁（第17条第1款；doctrine）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k-age16"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:age16to18"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:adult"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:age16plus"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k-under18"><lrml:Comment>不满十八周岁（第17条第4款；doctrine）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k-under18"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:age12to14"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:age14to16"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:age16to18"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:under18"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k17-1"><lrml:Comment>已满十六周岁的人犯罪，应当负刑事责任（第17条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k17-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constitutes"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:age16plus"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k17-2-intentionalHomicide"><lrml:Comment>已满十四不满十六周岁，犯故意杀人、故意伤害致人重伤或死亡、强奸、抢劫、贩卖毒品、放火、爆炸、投放危险物质罪的，应当负刑事责任（第17条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k17-2-intentionalHomicide"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constitutes"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>intentionalHomicide</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:age14to16"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>intentionalHomicide</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k17-2-intentionalInjury"><lrml:Comment>已满十四不满十六周岁，犯故意杀人、故意伤害致人重伤或死亡、强奸、抢劫、贩卖毒品、放火、爆炸、投放危险物质罪的，应当负刑事责任（第17条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k17-2-intentionalInjury"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constitutes"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>intentionalInjury</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:age14to16"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:causesGraveInjuryOrDeath"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>intentionalInjury</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k17-2-rape"><lrml:Comment>已满十四不满十六周岁，犯故意杀人、故意伤害致人重伤或死亡、强奸、抢劫、贩卖毒品、放火、爆炸、投放危险物质罪的，应当负刑事责任（第17条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k17-2-rape"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constitutes"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>rape</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:age14to16"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>rape</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k17-2-robbery"><lrml:Comment>已满十四不满十六周岁，犯故意杀人、故意伤害致人重伤或死亡、强奸、抢劫、贩卖毒品、放火、爆炸、投放危险物质罪的，应当负刑事责任（转化型抢劫除外，见司法解释）（第17条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k17-2-robbery"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constitutes"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>robbery</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:age14to16"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:convertedRobbery"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>robbery</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k17-2-drugTrafficking"><lrml:Comment>已满十四不满十六周岁，犯故意杀人、故意伤害致人重伤或死亡、强奸、抢劫、贩卖毒品、放火、爆炸、投放危险物质罪的，应当负刑事责任（第17条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k17-2-drugTrafficking"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constitutes"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>drugTrafficking</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:age14to16"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>drugTrafficking</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k17-2-arson"><lrml:Comment>已满十四不满十六周岁，犯故意杀人、故意伤害致人重伤或死亡、强奸、抢劫、贩卖毒品、放火、爆炸、投放危险物质罪的，应当负刑事责任（第17条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k17-2-arson"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constitutes"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>arson</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:age14to16"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>arson</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k17-2-explosion"><lrml:Comment>已满十四不满十六周岁，犯故意杀人、故意伤害致人重伤或死亡、强奸、抢劫、贩卖毒品、放火、爆炸、投放危险物质罪的，应当负刑事责任（第17条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k17-2-explosion"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constitutes"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>explosion</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:age14to16"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>explosion</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k17-2-poisoning"><lrml:Comment>已满十四不满十六周岁，犯故意杀人、故意伤害致人重伤或死亡、强奸、抢劫、贩卖毒品、放火、爆炸、投放危险物质罪的，应当负刑事责任（第17条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k17-2-poisoning"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constitutes"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>poisoning</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:age14to16"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>poisoning</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k17-3"><lrml:Comment>已满十二不满十四周岁，犯故意杀人、故意伤害罪，致人死亡或以特别残忍手段致人重伤造成严重残疾，情节恶劣，经最高人民检察院核准追诉的，应当负刑事责任（第17条第3款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k17-3"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constitutes"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:age12to14"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constitutes"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>intentionalHomicide</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constitutes"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>intentionalInjury</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:causesDeath"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:especiallyCruelGraveDisability"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:heinous"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sppApprovedProsecution"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="k17-4"><lrml:Comment>对不满十八周岁的人应当从轻或者减轻处罚（第17条第4款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k17-4"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:under18"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="k17-4-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>对不满十八周岁的人应当从轻或者减轻处罚</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>lighterOrReduced</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
              <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="k17-1b"><lrml:Comment>已满七十五周岁的人故意犯罪的，可以从轻或者减轻处罚（第17条之一；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k17-1b"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:age75plus"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:intentionalCrime"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Permission key="k17-1b-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>已满七十五周岁的人故意犯罪的，可以从轻或者减轻处罚</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>lighterOrReduced</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Permission></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
              <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="k17-1c"><lrml:Comment>已满七十五周岁的人过失犯罪的，应当从轻或者减轻处罚（第17条之一；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k17-1c"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:age75plus"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:negligentCrime"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="k17-1c-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>已满七十五周岁的人过失犯罪的，应当从轻或者减轻处罚</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>lighterOrReduced</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k-minor-conv"><lrml:Comment>已满十四不满十六周岁的人盗窃、诈骗、抢夺后当场使用暴力，故意伤害致人重伤或者死亡的，以故意伤害罪定罪处罚，不成立（转化型）抢劫罪（《最高人民法院关于审理未成年人刑事案件具体应用法律若干问题的解释》（法释〔2006〕1号）第10条第1款；spc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k-minor-conv"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:convertedRobbery"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:age14to16"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:violenceOnTheSpot"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:causesGraveInjuryOrDeath"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constitutes"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>intentionalInjury</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k18-1"><lrml:Comment>精神病人在不能辨认或者不能控制自己行为时造成危害结果，经法定程序鉴定确认的，不负刑事责任（第18条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k18-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constitutes"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mentallyIll"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:unableToRecognizeOrControlAtTime"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:forensicallyCertified"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="k18-3"><lrml:Comment>尚未完全丧失辨认或者控制能力的精神病人犯罪的，应当负刑事责任，但是可以从轻或者减轻处罚（第18条第3款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k18-3"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:mentallyIll"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:partiallyImpairedCapacity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Permission key="k18-3-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>尚未完全丧失辨认或者控制能力的精神病人犯罪的，应当负刑事责任，但是可以从轻或者减轻处罚</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>lighterOrReduced</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Permission></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
                <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="k19"><lrml:Comment>又聋又哑的人或者盲人犯罪，可以从轻、减轻或者免除处罚（第19条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k19"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:deafAndMute"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:blind"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Permission key="k19-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>又聋又哑的人或者盲人犯罪，可以从轻、减轻或者免除处罚</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>lighterReducedOrExempt</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Permission></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k20-1"><lrml:Comment>正当防卫，不负刑事责任（第20条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k20-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:defenseConditions"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constitutes"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:excessiveDefense"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:justifiedDefense"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k20-cond"><lrml:Comment>起因（不法侵害）、时间（正在进行）、对象（不法侵害人）、主观（防卫意图）（第20条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k20-cond"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:defensiveAct"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ongoingUnlawfulAttack"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:harmToAttacker"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:defensiveIntent"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:defenseConditions"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k20-3"><lrml:Comment>对行凶、杀人、抢劫、强奸、绑架等严重危及人身安全的暴力犯罪防卫，造成伤亡的，不属于防卫过当，不负刑事责任（第20条第3款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k20-3"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:defenseConditions"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constitutes"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:violentCrimeEndangeringLife"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:justifiedDefense"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k20-2"><lrml:Comment>正当防卫明显超过必要限度造成重大损害的，是防卫过当（第20条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k20-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:defenseConditions"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:obviouslyExceedsNecessity"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:causesSeriousHarm"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:violentCrimeEndangeringLife"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:excessiveDefense"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="k20-2b"><lrml:Comment>防卫过当应当负刑事责任，但是应当减轻或者免除处罚（第20条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k20-2b"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:excessiveDefense"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="k20-2b-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>防卫过当应当负刑事责任，但是应当减轻或者免除处罚</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>reducedOrExempt</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k20-late"><lrml:Comment>不法侵害已经结束后的“防卫”是事后防卫，不成立正当防卫（第20条第1款；doctrine）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k20-late"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:defensiveAct"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:attackAlreadyEnded"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:defenseConditions"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k21-1"><lrml:Comment>紧急避险，不负刑事责任（第21条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k21-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:necessityConditions"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constitutes"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:excessiveNecessity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:justifiedNecessity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:And></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k21-cond"><lrml:Comment>正在发生的危险、不得已、损害另一合法权益；避免本人危险不适用于负有特定责任的人（第21条第3款）（第21条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k21-cond"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:avertsDanger"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ongoingDanger"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noOtherMeans"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:harmsThirdPartyInterest"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:specialDutyToFaceOwnDanger"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:necessityConditions"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k21-2"><lrml:Comment>紧急避险超过必要限度造成不应有的损害的，是避险过当（第21条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k21-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:necessityConditions"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:exceedsNecessityUndueHarm"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:excessiveNecessity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="k21-2b"><lrml:Comment>避险过当应当负刑事责任，但是应当减轻或者免除处罚（第21条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k21-2b"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:excessiveNecessity"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="k21-2b-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>避险过当应当负刑事责任，但是应当减轻或者免除处罚</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>reducedOrExempt</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k22"><lrml:Comment>为了犯罪，准备工具、制造条件，因意志以外原因未能着手的，是犯罪预备（第22条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k22"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:preparedToolsOrConditions"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:commencedExecution"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:voluntarilyAbandoned"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:preparation"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="k22-2"><lrml:Comment>对于预备犯，可以比照既遂犯从轻、减轻处罚或者免除处罚（第22条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k22-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:preparation"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Permission key="k22-2-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>对于预备犯，可以比照既遂犯从轻、减轻处罚或者免除处罚</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>lighterReducedOrExempt</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Permission></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k23"><lrml:Comment>已经着手实行犯罪，由于犯罪分子意志以外的原因而未得逞的，是犯罪未遂（第23条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k23"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:commencedExecution"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:notAccomplished"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:voluntarilyAbandoned"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:attempt"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="k23-2"><lrml:Comment>对于未遂犯，可以比照既遂犯从轻或者减轻处罚（第23条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k23-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:attempt"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Permission key="k23-2-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>对于未遂犯，可以比照既遂犯从轻或者减轻处罚</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>lighterOrReduced</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Permission></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k24"><lrml:Comment>在犯罪过程中，自动放弃犯罪或者自动有效地防止犯罪结果发生的，是犯罪中止（第24条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k24"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:voluntarilyAbandoned"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:notAccomplished"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:discontinuance"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="k24-2a"><lrml:Comment>对于中止犯，没有造成损害的，应当免除处罚（第24条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k24-2a"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:discontinuance"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:causedDamage"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="k24-2a-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>对于中止犯，没有造成损害的，应当免除处罚</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>exempt</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
                <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="k24-2b"><lrml:Comment>对于中止犯，造成损害的，应当减轻处罚（第24条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k24-2b"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:discontinuance"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:causedDamage"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="k24-2b-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>对于中止犯，造成损害的，应当减轻处罚</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>reduced</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k24-noAttempt"><lrml:Comment>自动性是犯罪中止区别于未遂、预备的标志（第24条第1款；doctrine）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k24-noAttempt"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:voluntarilyAbandoned"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:notAccomplished"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:commencedExecution"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:attempt"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                    <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="k27"><lrml:Comment>在共同犯罪中起次要或者辅助作用的，是从犯，应当从轻、减轻处罚或者免除处罚（第27条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k27"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:accessoryRole"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="k27-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>在共同犯罪中起次要或者辅助作用的，是从犯，应当从轻、减轻处罚或者免除处罚</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>lighterReducedOrExempt</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
                <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="k28"><lrml:Comment>对于被胁迫参加犯罪的，应当按照他的犯罪情节减轻处罚或者免除处罚（第28条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k28"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:coercedToParticipate"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="k28-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>对于被胁迫参加犯罪的，应当按照他的犯罪情节减轻处罚或者免除处罚</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>reducedOrExempt</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
                  <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="k29-1"><lrml:Comment>教唆不满十八周岁的人犯罪的，应当从重处罚（第29条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k29-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:instigates"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Q</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:under18"/><ruleml:Var>Q</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="k29-1-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>教唆不满十八周岁的人犯罪的，应当从重处罚</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>heavier</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
                <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="k29-2"><lrml:Comment>被教唆的人没有犯被教唆的罪的，对于教唆犯，可以从轻或者减轻处罚（第29条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k29-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:instigates"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Q</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:instigatedDidNotCommit"/><ruleml:Var>Q</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Permission key="k29-2-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>被教唆的人没有犯被教唆的罪的，对于教唆犯，可以从轻或者减轻处罚</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>lighterOrReduced</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Permission></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-t1694"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：哲学根据 ⊑ 刑事责任的根据</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-t1694"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>哲学根据</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>刑事责任的根据</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-t1696"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：法学根据 ⊑ 刑事责任的根据</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-t1696"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>法学根据</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>刑事责任的根据</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-t1786"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：学理分类 ⊑ 刑罚的种类</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-t1786"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>学理分类</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>刑罚的种类</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-t1792"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：刑法中的分类 ⊑ 刑罚的种类</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-t1792"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>刑法中的分类</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>刑罚的种类</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-t1827"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：有期徒刑 ⊑ 主刑</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-t1827"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>有期徒刑</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>主刑</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-t1838"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：无期徒刑 ⊑ 主刑</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-t1838"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>无期徒刑</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>主刑</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-t1847"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：死刑 ⊑ 主刑</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-t1847"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>死刑</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>主刑</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k65"><lrml:Comment>一般累犯：前罪被判有期徒刑以上，执行完毕或赦免后五年内再犯应判有期徒刑以上之罪；过失犯罪和不满十八周岁的人犯罪的除外（第65条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k65"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:priorSentenceFixedTermOrAbove"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:within5YearsAfterRelease"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:newCrimeDeservesFixedTerm"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:negligentCrime"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:priorNegligent"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:under18AtPriorCrime"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:under18"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:recidivist"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k66"><lrml:Comment>危害国家安全、恐怖活动、黑社会性质组织犯罪的犯罪分子，在任何时候再犯上述任一类罪的，都以累犯论处（第66条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k66"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:priorSpecialCategoryCrime"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:specialCategoryCrime"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:priorSentenceServedOrPardoned"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:recidivist"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                  <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="k65-sent"><lrml:Comment>累犯应当从重处罚（第65条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k65-sent"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:recidivist"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="k65-sent-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>累犯应当从重处罚</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>heavier</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
                <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="k74"><lrml:Comment>对于累犯和犯罪集团的首要分子，不适用缓刑（第74条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k74"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:recidivist"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:ringleaderOfCriminalGroup"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Prohibition key="k74-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>对于累犯和犯罪集团的首要分子，不适用缓刑</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>probation</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Prohibition></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
                  <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k67-1"><lrml:Comment>犯罪以后自动投案，如实供述自己的罪行的，是自首（第67条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k67-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:surrendersVoluntarily"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:confessesTruthfully"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:surrender"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                  <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k67-2"><lrml:Comment>被采取强制措施的犯罪嫌疑人、被告人和正在服刑的罪犯，如实供述司法机关还未掌握的本人其他罪行的，以自首论（第67条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k67-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:underCoerciveMeasureOrServing"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:confessesOtherCrimeUnknownToAuthorities"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:surrender"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                  <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k67-3"><lrml:Comment>不具有自首情节，但如实供述自己罪行的，是坦白（第67条第3款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k67-3"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:confessesTruthfully"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:surrender"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:confession"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="k67-3s"><lrml:Comment>坦白的，可以从轻处罚（第67条第3款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k67-3s"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:confession"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Permission key="k67-3s-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>坦白的，可以从轻处罚</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>lighter</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Permission></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
                <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="k67-3b"><lrml:Comment>因如实供述避免特别严重后果发生的，可以减轻处罚（第67条第3款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k67-3b"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:confession"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:avertedEspeciallySeriousConsequence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Permission key="k67-3b-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>因如实供述避免特别严重后果发生的，可以减轻处罚</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>reduced</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Permission></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
                <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="k67-1s"><lrml:Comment>对于自首的犯罪分子，可以从轻或者减轻处罚（第67条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k67-1s"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:surrender"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Permission key="k67-1s-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>对于自首的犯罪分子，可以从轻或者减轻处罚</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>lighterOrReduced</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Permission></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
                <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="k67-1e"><lrml:Comment>犯罪较轻的，可以免除处罚（第67条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k67-1e"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:surrender"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:minorCrime"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Permission key="k67-1e-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>犯罪较轻的，可以免除处罚</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>exempt</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Permission></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
                <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="k68"><lrml:Comment>有揭发他人犯罪行为查证属实等立功表现的，可以从轻或者减轻处罚（第68条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k68"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:meritoriousService"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Permission key="k68-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>有揭发他人犯罪行为查证属实等立功表现的，可以从轻或者减轻处罚</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>lighterOrReduced</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Permission></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
              <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="k68-major"><lrml:Comment>有重大立功表现的，可以减轻或者免除处罚（第68条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k68-major"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:majorMeritoriousService"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Permission key="k68-major-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>有重大立功表现的，可以减轻或者免除处罚</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>reducedOrExempt</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Permission></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
              <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="k72"><lrml:Comment>被判处拘役、三年以下有期徒刑，同时符合情节较轻、有悔罪表现、没有再犯罪危险、对社区无重大不良影响的，可以宣告缓刑（第72条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k72"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentencedDetentionOrUpTo3Years"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lightCircumstances"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:showsRepentance"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noRiskOfReoffending"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noMajorAdverseCommunityImpact"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Permission key="k72-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>被判处拘役、三年以下有期徒刑，同时符合情节较轻、有悔罪表现、没有再犯罪危险、对社区无重大不良影响的，可以宣告缓刑</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>probation</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Permission></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
                <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="k72-must"><lrml:Comment>其中不满十八周岁的人、怀孕的妇女和已满七十五周岁的人，应当宣告缓刑（第72条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k72-must"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentencedDetentionOrUpTo3Years"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:lightCircumstances"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:showsRepentance"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noRiskOfReoffending"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noMajorAdverseCommunityImpact"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:under18"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:pregnant"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:age75plus"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Obligation key="k72-must-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>其中不满十八周岁的人、怀孕的妇女和已满七十五周岁的人，应当宣告缓刑</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>probation</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Obligation></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-t2596"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：对象条件 ⊑ 减刑的条件</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-t2596"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>对象条件</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>减刑的条件</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-t2602"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：实质条件 ⊑ 减刑的条件</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-t2602"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>实质条件</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>减刑的条件</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-t2604"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：可以减刑的实质条件 ⊑ 实质条件</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-t2604"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>可以减刑的实质条件</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>实质条件</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-t2622"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：应当减刑的实质条件 ⊑ 实质条件</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-t2622"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>应当减刑的实质条件</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>实质条件</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-t2712"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：对象条件 ⊑ 假释的条件</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-t2712"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>对象条件</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>假释的条件</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-t2721"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：实质条件 ⊑ 假释的条件</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-t2721"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>实质条件</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>假释的条件</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-t2731"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：限制条件 ⊑ 假释的条件</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-t2731"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>限制条件</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>假释的条件</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="k81-1"><lrml:Comment>执行原判刑期二分之一以上（无期徒刑实际执行十三年以上），确有悔改表现，没有再犯罪危险的，可以假释（第81条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k81-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:servedHalfOrThirteenYears"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:abidesPrisonRules"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:showsRepentance"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:noRiskOfReoffending"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Permission key="k81-1-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>执行原判刑期二分之一以上（无期徒刑实际执行十三年以上），确有悔改表现，没有再犯罪危险的，可以假释</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>parole</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Permission></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
                <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="k81-2"><lrml:Comment>对累犯以及因故意杀人、强奸、抢劫、绑架、放火、爆炸、投放危险物质或有组织的暴力性犯罪被判处十年以上有期徒刑、无期徒刑的，不得假释（第81条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k81-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:recidivist"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:violentListedCrime"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentenced10YearsOrMore"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:Or></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Prohibition key="k81-2-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>对累犯以及因故意杀人、强奸、抢劫、绑架、放火、爆炸、投放危险物质或有组织的暴力性犯罪被判处十年以上有期徒刑、无期徒刑的，不得假释</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>parole</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Prohibition></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k87-under5"><lrml:Comment>犯罪经过下列期限不再追诉：法定最高刑为不满五年有期徒刑的，经过五年（第87条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k87-under5"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:maxStatutoryPenalty"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>under5</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:elapsedAtLeast"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>y5</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:timeBarred"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k87-from5to10"><lrml:Comment>犯罪经过下列期限不再追诉：五年以上不满十年的，经过十年（第87条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k87-from5to10"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:maxStatutoryPenalty"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>from5to10</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:elapsedAtLeast"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>y10</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:timeBarred"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k87-from10"><lrml:Comment>犯罪经过下列期限不再追诉：十年以上有期徒刑的，经过十五年（第87条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k87-from10"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:maxStatutoryPenalty"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>from10</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:elapsedAtLeast"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>y15</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:timeBarred"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k87-lifeOrDeath"><lrml:Comment>犯罪经过下列期限不再追诉：无期徒刑、死刑的，经过二十年（第87条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k87-lifeOrDeath"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:maxStatutoryPenalty"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>lifeOrDeath</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:elapsedAtLeast"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>y20</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sppApprovedProsecution"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:timeBarred"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k87-noProsec"><lrml:Comment>超过追诉期限的，不再追诉（第87条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k87-noProsec"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:timeBarred"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:responsible"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>C</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:notProsecuted"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k88-1"><lrml:Comment>立案侦查或者法院受理案件以后，逃避侦查或者审判的，不受追诉期限的限制（第88条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k88-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:caseFiledOrAccepted"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:evadesInvestigationOrTrial"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:timeBarred"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                  <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k88-2"><lrml:Comment>被害人在追诉期限内提出控告，应当立案而不予立案的，不受追诉期限的限制（第88条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k88-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:victimComplainedWithinPeriod"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:authoritiesFailedToFileCase"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:timeBarred"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
