              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k133"><lrml:Comment>违反交通运输管理法规，因而发生重大事故，致人重伤、死亡或者使公私财产遭受重大损失的（第133条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k133"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:violatesTrafficRegulations"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:majorAccident"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:causesGraveInjuryOrDeath"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:majorPropertyLoss"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constitutes"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>trafficAccident</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k133-flee"><lrml:Comment>交通运输肇事后逃逸：处三年以上七年以下有期徒刑（第133条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k133-flee"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:convicted"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>trafficAccident</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fleesAfterAccident"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:trafficAccidentFleeing"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                      <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k133-fleedeath"><lrml:Comment>因逃逸致人死亡的，处七年以上有期徒刑（第133条；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k133-fleedeath"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:convicted"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>trafficAccident</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:fleesAfterAccident"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:victimDiesBecauseOfFleeing"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:trafficAccidentFleeingDeath"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                        <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k133-1"><lrml:Comment>在道路上驾驶机动车，追逐竞驶情节恶劣、醉酒驾驶、校车或客运严重超员超速、违规运输危险化学品的（第133条之一第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k133-1"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:drivesMotorVehicleOnRoad"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:racingSerious"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:drunkDriving"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:seriousOverloadOrSpeeding"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:illegalHazardousTransport"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constitutes"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>dangerousDriving</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
