              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-t7172"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：侵占罪是亲告罪 ⊑ 是否属于亲告罪</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-t7172"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>侵占罪是亲告罪</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>是否属于亲告罪</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
