                    <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k271"><lrml:Comment>单位工作人员利用职务便利，将本单位财物非法占为己有，数额较大的（第271条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k271"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:employeeOfUnit"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:usesPosition"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:appropriatesUnitProperty"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:amountRelativelyLarge"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:stateFunctionary"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constitutes"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>occupationalEmbezzlement</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k271-2"><lrml:Comment>国有单位中从事公务的人员有前款行为的，依照贪污罪定罪处罚（第271条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k271-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:employeeOfUnit"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:usesPosition"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:appropriatesUnitProperty"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:stateFunctionary"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constitutes"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>corruption</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
