            <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k382"><lrml:Comment>国家工作人员利用职务上的便利，侵吞、窃取、骗取或者以其他手段非法占有公共财物的，是贪污罪（第382条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k382"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:stateFunctionary"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:usesPosition"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:appropriatesPublicProperty"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constitutes"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>corruption</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k382-2"><lrml:Comment>受国家机关、国有单位委托管理、经营国有财产的人员，利用职务便利非法占有国有财物的，以贪污论（第382条第2款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k382-2"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:entrustedToManageStateAssets"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:usesPosition"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:appropriatesPublicProperty"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constitutes"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>corruption</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k382-3"><lrml:Comment>与前两款所列人员勾结，伙同贪污的，以共犯论处（第382条第3款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k382-3"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:colludesWith"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>Q</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constitutes"/><ruleml:Var>Q</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>corruption</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constitutes"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>corruption</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-t8978"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：罪与非罪 ⊑ 贪污罪</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-t8978"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>罪与非罪</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>贪污罪</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-t8995"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：此罪与彼罪 ⊑ 贪污罪</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-t8995"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>此罪与彼罪</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>贪污罪</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-t8917"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：第三百八十二条 ⊑ 相关法条</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-t8917"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>第三百八十二条</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>相关法条</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-t8921"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：第三百八十三条 ⊑ 相关法条</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-t8921"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>第三百八十三条</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>相关法条</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k385"><lrml:Comment>国家工作人员利用职务上的便利，索取他人财物，或者非法收受他人财物、为他人谋取利益的，是受贿罪（第385条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k385"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:stateFunctionary"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:usesPosition"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Or><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:solicitsProperty"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:acceptsProperty"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:seeksBenefitForGiver"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:Or></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constitutes"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>bribeTaking</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k389"><lrml:Comment>为谋取不正当利益，给予国家工作人员以财物的，是行贿罪（第389条第1款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k389"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:givesPropertyToFunctionary"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:seeksImproperBenefit"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constitutes"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>bribeGiving</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:PrescriptiveStatement key="k390-3"><lrml:Comment>行贿人在被追诉前主动交待行贿行为的，可以从轻或者减轻处罚（第390条第3款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k390-3"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:convicted"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>bribeGiving</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:confessesBeforeProsecution"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><lrml:SuborderList><lrml:Permission key="k390-3-h0"><lrml:Paraphrase>行贿人在被追诉前主动交待行贿行为的，可以从轻或者减轻处罚</lrml:Paraphrase><ruleml:slot><lrml:Bearer/><ruleml:Ind>court</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:slot><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:sentence"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>lighterOrReduced</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></lrml:Permission></lrml:SuborderList></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:PrescriptiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="k389-3"><lrml:Comment>因被勒索给予国家工作人员以财物，没有获得不正当利益的，不是行贿（第389条第3款；npc）</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":k389-3"><ruleml:if><ruleml:And><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:givesPropertyToFunctionary"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:extortedByFunctionary"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Naf><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:obtainedImproperBenefit"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Naf></ruleml:And></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Neg><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:constitutes"/><ruleml:Var>P</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>bribeGiving</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:Neg></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
                <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-t9282"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：罪与非罪 ⊑ 对有影响力的人行贿罪</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-t9282"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>罪与非罪</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>对有影响力的人行贿罪</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-t9284"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：此罪与彼罪 ⊑ 对有影响力的人行贿罪</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-t9284"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>此罪与彼罪</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>对有影响力的人行贿罪</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
              <lrml:ConstitutiveStatement key="tx-t9314"><lrml:Comment>分类（自动抽取自图的层级）：罪与非罪 ⊑ 巨额财产来源不明罪</lrml:Comment><ruleml:Rule closure="universal" key=":tx-t9314"><ruleml:if><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>罪与非罪</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:if><ruleml:then><ruleml:Atom><ruleml:Rel iri="cnv:isA"/><ruleml:Var>X</ruleml:Var><ruleml:Ind>巨额财产来源不明罪</ruleml:Ind></ruleml:Atom></ruleml:then></ruleml:Rule></lrml:ConstitutiveStatement>
